  questionText: 8. Transition from altitude to flight level, and vice-versa, is done
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: During climb, aircraft change from altitude to flight level at
    the transition altitude. During descent, they change from flight level to altitude
    at the transition level.
  options:
  - at transition level during the climbs and at transition altitude in the descent
  - only at transition altitude
  - only at transition level
  - at transition altitude during the climbs and at transition level in the descent
  correctOptionIndex: 3
